## Telegram student archive

The Telegram bot supports an interactive Class X lecture archive.

- `/start` opens inline keyboard menus
- Students choose a subject: English, Computer Science, Physics, Chemistry, or Mathematics
- Browse PDFs, videos, audio recordings, a specific date, or a date range
- Date-range searches are limited to seven days
- Local PDFs and audio are delivered directly to Telegram
- Larger video/audio files fall back to Google Drive links
- `/sr` and `/search` remain available as legacy text-based search commands
- Administrative commands require an allowed Telegram user ID

Example text searches:

```text
/sr Physics/27/11/26
/search English/27/11/26
```

