## Hardware

### Wall display / behind-screen pod

- 800×480 HDMI/DSI touch display
- NodeMCU ESP-32S 38-pin controller
- PN532 NFC V3 reader in I²C mode
- GPIO 21 SDA / GPIO 22 SCL
- GPIO 27 piezo-buzzer control
- Wi-Fi TCP connection to the Pi 5
- 5 V display and ESP32 power supply
- Common ground bus

### Raspberry Pi 5 edge hub

- Raspberry Pi 5
- Kreo Owl 4K USB camera or compatible V4L2 camera
- USB conference microphone
- HDMI projector or classroom display
- Optional GPIO or kiosk display

Default pod listener settings:

```text
POD_SERVER_HOST=0.0.0.0
POD_SERVER_PORT=8765
KERO_VIDEO_DEVICE=/dev/video0
KERO_WIDTH=3840
KERO_HEIGHT=2160
KERO_FPS=30
```

