## Software dependencies

The Python runtime uses:

- Flask
- Requests
- psutil
- Pillow
- Google API Python Client
- Google OAuth libraries

Install the requirements:

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

System utilities commonly required on Raspberry Pi OS:

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install -y python3-pip python3-opencv ffmpeg fswebcam v4l2-utils alsa-utils
```

ESP32 touch-firmware libraries include TFT_eSPI, Adafruit PN532, Adafruit BusIO, and ArduinoJson.

