## Raspberry Pi kiosk mode

`launch_kiosk.sh` detects Wayland or X11, waits for the Flask backend, disables X11 screen blanking, finds Chromium, and opens the kiosk route in fullscreen mode.

Install the systemd service with:

```bash
sudo cp veronica-kiosk.service /etc/systemd/system/
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable --now veronica-kiosk.service
```

The service and script paths are deployment-specific. Update the `User`, `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`, `WorkingDirectory`, and `ExecStart` fields if the repository is not installed under `/home/lookforthelight/Project Veronica`.

